{"type":"text","timestamp":1787402764658,"sessionID":"ses_fd67fe98cffey1I2qfocHFic9y","part":{"id":"prt_02981b0c6001ub9wpAwpn7OI8Y","messageID":"msg_02980fb0b001ifuP7M2MmeMQl7","sessionID":"ses_fd67fe98cffey1I2qfocHFic9y","type":"text","text":"Now I understand the structure. The key tokens are `COERCE`, `COERCEFULL` (and global `COERCERTL`/`COERCERTLFULL`). I'll implement the canonical approach using the anchored-at-end technique for `rtl`, building fresh non-global regexes from the token sources to avoid `lastIndex` leakage.","time":{"start":1787402760390,"end":1787402764654}}}
